Recommends: php-cli
Description: Qt GUI frontend for the whipper CD ripper
 Whipper Frontend provides a graphical interface for whipper, an accurate,
 AccurateRip-verifying CD ripper for Linux (in the spirit of EAC/XLD).
 .
 Features include drive read-offset detection, live per-track and
 overall rip progress, cover art fetching, custom file/folder naming
 templates, and optional rip log verification via OPSnet's logchecker
 (the same tool used by trackers such as Orpheus).
 .
 This package only wraps whipper's own command-line interface via
 subprocess — it does not modify or replace whipper itself.
